  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/graph1/). VERDICT: OBSOLETE. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f. Deliverable 2 populated dest_access_mode, which ADR-0038 ruling 3 removed (ir.py:141 and slice.py:96 say so). Deliverable 3 cross-references WI-hukoh, which closed done with defer-indefinitely, and the would_admit_dst_reader trigger is gone. Deliverable 1 asks type_hierarchy.py to disambiguate a multi-candidate registry. But _method_return_type_registry (analyze/base.py:4783-4800) is an analyzer-internal, first-writer-wins dict[str,str] that no linker reads, and the ambiguous-candidate problem is now tracked analyzer-side by INV-zujag, WI-jutur and WI-hubik. MECHANISM: Phase 5 assumed a linker-visible multi-candidate registry and the dest_access_mode field; neither exists (the registry is analyzer-internal and first-writer-wins, and dest_access_mode was removed). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-zujag,WI-jutur,WI-hubik. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 3170
